node_modules/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
build/
examples/*/build/
runtime/build/

# The sample Makefile copies ps2ui.[ch] beside main.c so the PS2SDK
# implicit rules pick them up, and bin2c generates ui_uib.c.
runtime/sample/ps2ui.c
runtime/sample/ps2ui.h
runtime/sample/ui_uib.c
runtime/sample/*.o
runtime/sample/*.elf
fixtures/bench-stream/build/

# Local build artifacts. `python -m build` in packages/baker is now an
# ordinary thing to run -- setup.py stages the runtime during it -- so
# these appear in a working tree that never made them before.
packages/baker/dist/
packages/baker/build/
*.egg-info/

# Staged by packages/baker/setup.py at build time from repo-root runtime/.
# One canonical copy lives in runtime/; this is the transient one that
# goes into the wheel and the sdist (F25). Committing it would recreate
# the stale-second-copy defect the hook exists to avoid.
packages/baker/ps2ui_bake/runtime/

# `tools/check-runtime-shipped.py --export` writes a stranger's project
# here in CI so the elf job can compile it. Build output of a check,
# not source: the starter it contains is committed at
# packages/baker/ps2ui_bake/starter/.
starter-project/

# console/Makefile copies the runtime beside main.c, as the sample's
# does, and generates the embedded theme and IOP module table.
console/ps2ui.c
console/ps2ui.h
console/theme_uib.c
console/irx_table.c
console/irx_table.h
console/*.o
console/*.elf

# THE GENERIC ACCIDENT CLASSES, which this file had no rule for at all.
# Every rule above is for a file this project generates on purpose;
# nothing below has ever been committed here, across 394 commits and 495
# distinct paths, so the gap was carried by discipline alone. These are
# the accidents: editor and OS droppings, crash and log output, and a
# virtualenv or .env someone makes inside the checkout.
#
# Worth closing because the exposure path is already demonstrated one
# directory over: the gitignored examples/channel6/build/*.json embed
# absolute `"src":` paths, so a file that reaches a commit by accident
# can carry a machine path in with it.
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
*.swo
*~
*.bak
*.log
.vscode/
.idea/
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.mypy_cache/
venv/
.venv/
.env
.env.*
